  "prefLabel": "Adm 1003.05 Defendant's Obligation to Maintain Contact with the Court and the Office of Cost Containment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1003.05 Defendant's Obligation to Maintain Contact with the Court and the Office of Cost Containment. A defendant for whom counsel has been appointed and for whom a repayment order has been issued, shall update his or her address and phone number with the clerk of the court and the office of cost containment every time there is a change of address or phone number during the period in which the defendant still owes the state for the cost of counsel or other defense services or expenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm1000.html"
